CSLib is supported by some strategic organizations that pursue long-term visions and roadmaps, read more below.

# CSLib Initiative

A programme by [Renaissance Philanthropy](https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org) whose mission is to support the growth of the CSLib open-source project, providing funding, staffing, coordination, and strategic focus. Read more on the [CSLib Initiative](/initiative) page.

# FORM

The Centre for Formal Methods and Future Computing, a strategic partner in the development of CSLib. Read more on the [FORM](/form) page.
